WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.651
The particles in the particle model are atoms, or atoms joined together.

2
00:00:05.802 --> 00:00:09.652
This is air, zoomed in: every particle is made of atoms.

3
00:00:11.814 --> 00:00:15.814
Two nitrogen atoms are joined: one element, nitrogen.

4
00:00:20.418 --> 00:00:25.093
Oxygen and argon are other elements; there are about a hundred and eighteen.
